#: ../../../library-hard.rst:64
msgid ""
"Both elements of ``a`` are the *same* list object. ``deepcopy`` uses a memo "
"so that shared identity is preserved in the copy: ``b[0]`` and ``b[1]`` are "
"still the same object, so appending to one shows up in both."
msgstr ""
"Ambos elementos de ``a`` son el *mismo* objeto lista. ``deepcopy`` usa un "
"memo para que la identidad compartida se preserve en la copia: ``b[0]`` y "
"``b[1]`` siguen siendo el mismo objeto, así que añadir a uno se refleja en "
"ambos."

