#: ../../../library-hard.rst:92
msgid ""
"``groupby`` only collapses *consecutive* equal items; it does not sort "
"first. The two runs of ``1`` are separated by a ``2``, so they form distinct"
" groups and the keys are ``[1, 2, 1]``."
msgstr ""
"``groupby`` solo colapsa elementos iguales *consecutivos*; no ordena "
"primero. Las dos secuencias de ``1`` están separadas por un ``2``, así que "
"forman grupos distintos y las claves son ``[1, 2, 1]``."

