#: ../../../library-hard.rst:120
msgid ""
"The ``-`` operator on ``Counter`` keeps only results with a *positive* "
"count. ``a`` becomes ``2`` and stays; ``b`` would be ``-1`` and is dropped "
"entirely. Use ``.subtract`` if you need to keep zero/negative counts."
msgstr ""
"El operador ``-`` sobre ``Counter`` conserva solo los resultados con un "
"recuento *positivo*. ``a`` pasa a ser ``2`` y se mantiene; ``b`` sería "
"``-1`` y se descarta por completo. Usa ``.subtract`` si necesitas conservar "
"recuentos cero/negativos."

