#: ../../../library-hard.rst:260
msgid ""
"By the IEEE-754 rule, NaN is not equal to anything, including itself, so "
"``math.nan == math.nan`` is ``False``. Use ``math.isnan`` to test for NaN."
msgstr ""
"Por la regla IEEE-754, NaN no es igual a nada, ni siquiera a sí mismo, así "
"que ``math.nan == math.nan`` es ``False``. Usa ``math.isnan`` para comprobar"
" si algo es NaN."

