#: ../../../library-hard.rst:286
msgid ""
"``Decimal(\"2.675\")`` is exactly 2.675, so rounding half up to two places "
"gives ``2.68``. The float ``round(2.675, 2)`` returns ``2.67`` because "
"``2.675`` cannot be represented exactly in binary."
msgstr ""
"``Decimal(\"2.675\")`` es exactamente 2.675, así que redondear al alza a dos"
" decimales da ``2.68``. El float ``round(2.675, 2)`` devuelve ``2.67`` "
"porque ``2.675`` no puede representarse exactamente en binario."

